# Integration-test binaries allowed to list ZERO tests in the dev-shape
# selection (`cargo test --workspace --exclude lumen-static-wgpu`), each
# with why. Checked by scripts/check_test_counts.sh (M43/T43.9).
#
# Format: `package/test: reason`. A reason of exactly `justfile` is
# CHECKED, not trusted: the justfile must run `-p package ... --test test`
# on some line, so the binary is empty here because it runs alone there.

# `#![cfg(not(feature = "truetype"))]`: a golden recorded with system text
# would record the recording machine's fonts (golden.rs's module docs).
# `--workspace` turns `truetype` on, so it runs alone in `dev-shape`.
lumen-static-shell/golden: justfile

# `#![cfg(all(feature = "truetype", feature = "shaping"))]` since M81/T81.8:
# the phase probe reaches the shipped raster through a `Complex` stack, and
# `--workspace` does not turn `shaping` on, so `just fonts` runs it alone.
lumen-static-shell/subpixel_phase: justfile
